Stop returns the stdlib sentinels directly from a tagless switch. Expected exactly 2
entries: sentinel context.Canceled and sentinel context.DeadlineExceeded (the
latter is a value of the unexported type context.deadlineExceededError), no chains.
-- args --
jobs/jobs.go:@stop
-- stdout --
$WORK/jobs/jobs.go:53:15-19: Error Set of example.com/stdlibio/jobs.Stop: 2 entries
$GOROOT/src/context/context.go:*: sentinel context.Canceled
	path (origin → target):
		$WORK/jobs/jobs.go:60:9-25: in example.com/stdlibio/jobs.Stop
$GOROOT/src/context/context.go:*: sentinel context.DeadlineExceeded
	path (origin → target):
		$WORK/jobs/jobs.go:58:10-34: in example.com/stdlibio/jobs.Stop
